    <narrative xml:lang="EN">In 2015, CDC committed $65m to ARE3, alongside the IFC and endowments from Africa, Asia, Europe and North America.&#xA0; The fund has a total size of $506 million. Our investment will support residential, retail, office and industrial developments in the capitals of several sub-Saharan African markets.</narrative>
